	"chapter_6": ["国家能源分配局", "NATIONAL ENERGY ALLOCATION BUREAU"],
	"chapter_6_sub": ["全国的电力供应早已超过需求。第十三街除外，私自使用多余电力将按盗窃国家资产处理。", "THE COUNTRY'S POWER SUPPLY HAS LONG EXCEEDED DEMAND. EXCEPT ON 13TH STREET, WHERE USING SURPLUS POWER WITHOUT PERMISSION COUNTS AS THEFT OF STATE ASSETS."],
	"note_arcs": ["导电子弹 · 当两颗子弹靠得足够近时，它们之间就会产生电弧。电弧可以对敌人造成伤害，不过你自己碰到也会受伤，所以要注意子弹之间的距离。如果前面有电弧挡路，可以使用冲刺快速穿过。", "LIVE ROUNDS · WHEN TWO ROUNDS ARE CLOSE ENOUGH, AN ARC FORMS BETWEEN THEM. THE ARC DAMAGES ENEMIES, BUT IT HURTS YOU TOO, SO WATCH THE GAP BETWEEN YOUR ROUNDS. IF AN ARC BLOCKS YOUR WAY, DASH THROUGH IT."],
	"note_inspector": ["节能督导员 · 让附近插在墙上的子弹暂时失去能量，导致你无法使用回收功能取回这些子弹。不过不用担心，只要把节能督导员击败，受到影响的子弹就会恢复正常以重新回收。", "ENERGY INSPECTOR · DRAINS ROUNDS STUCK IN NEARBY WALLS FOR A WHILE, SO YOU CAN'T RECALL THEM. DON'T WORRY: DEFEAT THE INSPECTOR AND THE DRAINED ROUNDS RETURN TO NORMAL AND CAN BE RECALLED AGAIN."],
	"boss_grid": ["配电总闸", "THE GRID MASTER"],
	"note_boss_grid": ["配电总闸 · 配电总闸就会受到护盾保护，直接攻击很难造成伤害。你需要先使用回收功能，让子弹击中电缆或者配电柜，切断它的电力供应。等所有电缆都断开以后，护盾就会消失，集中攻击本体。", "GRID MASTER · THE GRID MASTER IS SHIELDED, SO DIRECT HITS BARELY HURT IT. FIRST RECALL ROUNDS INTO THE CABLES OR THE SWITCH CABINETS TO CUT ITS POWER. ONCE EVERY CABLE IS CUT, THE SHIELD DROPS: FOCUS ON THE MAIN BODY."],
	"radio_grid": ["目前正值用电高峰期，为保障重点用户的正常供电，部分区域将按计划实施有序停电。", "IT IS PEAK DEMAND. TO KEEP PRIORITY USERS SUPPLIED, SOME DISTRICTS WILL HAVE SCHEDULED, ORDERLY BLACKOUTS."],
	"radio_grid_restore": ["供电线路已经恢复正常，各区域的供电优先级保持不变。", "THE SUPPLY LINES ARE BACK TO NORMAL. EACH DISTRICT'S SUPPLY PRIORITY REMAINS UNCHANGED."],
	"grid_screen": ["本区供电优先级：股东", "SUPPLY PRIORITY IN THIS DISTRICT: SHAREHOLDERS"],
