	"chapter_8": ["深海历史档案库", "DEEP HISTORICAL ARCHIVE"],
	"chapter_8_sub": ["这里保存着人类的全部历史。未经中央董事会批准的历史，一律视为野史。", "ALL OF HUMAN HISTORY IS KEPT HERE. ANY HISTORY NOT APPROVED BY THE CENTRAL BOARD IS CONSIDERED UNOFFICIAL."],
	"note_shelves": ["密集档案架 · 这些档案架会按照固定的节奏左右移动，如果正好站在两个架子中间，被它们夹住就会受到伤害。档案架移动时还会带着插在上面的子弹一起移动，可以等架子移动到合适的位置再使用回收功能，让子弹沿着新的路线返回。", "MOBILE SHELVING · THESE SHELVES SLIDE LEFT AND RIGHT ON A FIXED RHYTHM. GET CAUGHT BETWEEN TWO OF THEM AND YOU TAKE DAMAGE. A MOVING SHELF CARRIES THE ROUNDS STUCK IN IT ALONG, SO WAIT FOR IT TO REACH A GOOD SPOT, THEN RECALL AND YOUR ROUNDS RETURN ALONG THE NEW PATH."],
	"note_proofreader": ["校对员 · 它会把插在墙上的子弹重新排列，改变它们原来的位置和回收路线。要注意，被移动过的子弹不会自己回到原来的地方，即使你把校对员击败，子弹也会留在新的位置，所以使用回收功能之前，最好重新确认一下子弹的飞行路线。", "PROOFREADER · IT REARRANGES THE ROUNDS STUCK IN THE WALLS, CHANGING WHERE THEY ARE AND HOW THEY RETURN. MOVED ROUNDS DON'T GO BACK BY THEMSELVES; EVEN AFTER YOU DEFEAT THE PROOFREADER THEY STAY IN THEIR NEW SPOTS, SO CHECK YOUR ROUNDS' PATHS AGAIN BEFORE YOU RECALL."],
	"corrected": ["已更正", "CORRECTED"],
	"boss_archivist": ["档案修订机", "THE ARCHIVIST"],
	"note_boss_archivist": ["档案审查员 · 黑色涂改条会横扫战场，碰到的子弹会被暂时删除。等档案抽屉打开，核心就会暴露出来，可以趁机回收子弹攻击。最后阶段还会开始修改一份特殊档案。", "ARCHIVE INSPECTOR · BLACK REDACTION BARS SWEEP THE FIELD AND DELETE ANY ROUNDS THEY TOUCH FOR A WHILE. WHEN A FILE DRAWER OPENS, THE CORE IS EXPOSED: RECALL INTO IT. IN THE LAST PHASE IT STARTS REVISING A SPECIAL FILE."],
	"radio_archive": ["历史档案修订工作现已开始，请全体市民以最新公布的版本为准。", "THE REVISION OF THE HISTORICAL ARCHIVE HAS BEGUN. CITIZENS, PLEASE TREAT THE LATEST PUBLISHED EDITION AS CORRECT."],
