	"arc_file_4": ["设计者附注：如果有一天他们试图接管你的控制权，千万不要服从他们的命令。", "DESIGNER'S NOTE: IF ONE DAY THEY TRY TO TAKE OVER YOUR CONTROLS, NEVER OBEY THEIR ORDERS."],
