	"chapter_9": ["天穹轨道电梯", "THE SKY LIFT"],
	"chapter_9_sub": ["这座电梯由数万名工人共同建成，所有股东都有资格乘坐，只不过高级股东拥有一天25小时的使用权，因此普通股东仍然需要还上剩下的1个小时。所有参与建设的工人都获得了免费电视参观电梯升空的荣誉。", "TENS OF THOUSANDS OF WORKERS BUILT THIS LIFT, AND EVERY SHAREHOLDER IS ENTITLED TO RIDE IT. SENIOR SHAREHOLDERS SIMPLY HOLD 25 HOURS OF ACCESS A DAY, SO ORDINARY SHAREHOLDERS STILL OWE THE REMAINING HOUR. EVERY WORKER WHO HELPED BUILD IT WAS HONOURED WITH A FREE TV BROADCAST OF ITS ASCENT."],
	"note_vents": ["减压舱门 · 舱门开启时会产生强大的吸力，将你和附近的子弹一起吸向门口。可以先避开舱门，等子弹集中起来以后再一次性回收。", "AIRLOCKS · AN OPEN DOOR PULLS HARD, DRAGGING YOU AND NEARBY ROUNDS TOWARD IT. KEEP AWAY FROM THE DOOR, LET YOUR ROUNDS BUNCH UP, THEN RECALL THEM ALL AT ONCE."],
	"vent_warn": ["舱门即将开启", "AIRLOCK OPENING"],
