	"boss_counterweight": ["配重块", "THE COUNTERWEIGHT"],
	"note_boss_counterweight": ["配重装置 · 地面不断扩大的阴影就是配重即将砸下的位置。等配重落地，底部核心就会短暂暴露，可以趁机回收子弹攻击。后半段会有两块配重同时落下。", "COUNTERWEIGHT · THE GROWING SHADOW ON THE FLOOR SHOWS WHERE THE COUNTERWEIGHT WILL CRASH DOWN. ONCE IT LANDS, THE CORE UNDERNEATH IS EXPOSED FOR A MOMENT: RECALL INTO IT. IN THE SECOND HALF, TWO COUNTERWEIGHTS FALL AT ONCE."],
	"radio_counterweight": ["轨道电梯目前运行正常，请观景层的乘客远离配重作业区域。", "THE ORBITAL LIFT IS RUNNING NORMALLY. VIEWING-DECK PASSENGERS, PLEASE KEEP CLEAR OF THE COUNTERWEIGHT WORK AREA."],
	"radio_counterweight_spare": ["为了提高运输效率，备用配重现已投入使用。", "TO RAISE TRANSPORT EFFICIENCY, THE SPARE COUNTERWEIGHT IS NOW IN SERVICE."],
