	"chapter_10": ["近地轨道军工船坞", "THE ORBITAL ARMS YARD"],
	"chapter_10_sub": ["这里全年无休地生产战舰，每艘战舰都以“和平”命名。申请休假的工人将被认定为妨碍和平建设。", "THIS YARD BUILDS WARSHIPS ALL YEAR ROUND, AND EVERY SHIP IS NAMED 'PEACE'. WORKERS WHO ASK FOR LEAVE ARE FOUND TO BE OBSTRUCTING THE BUILDING OF PEACE."],
	"note_plates": ["漂浮船板 · 射击可以推动船体板，回收嵌在船体板里的子弹时，又会把整块船板迅速拉回来。调整好射击角度，就能利用船板撞击敌人。", "HULL PLATES ADRIFT · SHOOTING A PLATE PUSHES IT AWAY; RECALLING A ROUND STUCK IN IT YANKS THE WHOLE PLATE BACK FAST. GET THE ANGLE RIGHT AND YOU CAN RAM ENEMIES WITH IT."],
	"note_escort": ["护航无人机 · 这种无人机会围绕其他敌人飞行，拦截正在回收的子弹。优先击毁无人机，也可以调整子弹的回收角度，绕过它的拦截范围。", "ESCORT DRONE · CIRCLES OTHER ENEMIES AND INTERCEPTS ROUNDS ON THEIR WAY BACK. TAKE OUT THE DRONE FIRST, OR CHANGE YOUR RECALL ANGLE TO GET AROUND IT."],
	"boss_peace": ["在建战舰 · 和平股东号", "THE PEACE SHAREHOLDER (UNDER CONSTRUCTION)"],
	"note_boss_peace": ["战争装配机 · 机械臂会不断为核心安装装甲和炮塔。趁装甲还没有完全覆盖，尽快攻击暴露在外的结构，阻止装配机完成组装。随着装配进度提高，安装的炮塔会越来越多，火力也会逐渐增强。", "WAR ASSEMBLER · ITS ARMS KEEP FITTING ARMOUR AND TURRETS TO THE CORE. HIT THE EXPOSED FRAME BEFORE THE ARMOUR COVERS IT, TO STOP THE ASSEMBLER FINISHING THE BUILD. THE FURTHER THE BUILD GOES, THE MORE TURRETS IT FITS AND THE HEAVIER THE FIRE."],
	"radio_peace": ["和平号已进入总装阶段，请所有人员配合施工，不得干扰和平建设。", "THE PEACE HAS ENTERED FINAL ASSEMBLY. ALL PERSONNEL MUST COOPERATE WITH THE WORK AND MUST NOT OBSTRUCT THE BUILDING OF PEACE."],
	"radio_peace_1": ["和平号的龙骨部分已经完工，装甲部分现已开始施工。", "THE PEACE'S KEEL IS COMPLETE. WORK ON THE ARMOUR HAS BEGUN."],
	"radio_peace_2": ["和平号的武装部分已经开始施工。为了保障和平，所有火炮均已完成校准。", "WORK ON THE PEACE'S ARMAMENT HAS BEGUN. TO SAFEGUARD PEACE, ALL GUNS HAVE BEEN CALIBRATED."],
