	"chapter_11": ["中央异常物理研究所", "CENTRAL INSTITUTE OF ANOMALOUS PHYSICS"],
	"chapter_11_sub": ["这里专门研究一切未经批准就存在的东西。你的拆解申请已经获得批准。", "THIS PLACE STUDIES EVERYTHING THAT EXISTS WITHOUT APPROVAL. YOUR DISMANTLING REQUEST HAS BEEN APPROVED."],
	"note_stasis": ["静滞场 · 子弹进入静滞场后会悬停在空中，你和敌人的行动速度也会降低。此时回收子弹，子弹会从悬停的位置沿原路返回。如果关闭静滞场，还没有回收的子弹就会继续向前飞行。", "STASIS FIELDS · ROUNDS THAT ENTER A FIELD HANG IN THE AIR, AND YOU AND THE ENEMIES MOVE SLOWER. RECALL NOW AND THE ROUNDS RETURN FROM WHERE THEY HANG ALONG THEIR PATH. IF THE FIELD SHUTS OFF, ANY ROUNDS NOT YET RECALLED FLY ON."],
	"note_phase": ["相位体 · 会不断在实体状态和虚化状态之间切换。虚化期间，普通子弹和回收中的子弹都无法造成伤害。注意观察它的状态变化，等它恢复实体后，再使用回收攻击。", "PHASER · KEEPS SWITCHING BETWEEN SOLID AND PHASED. WHILE IT IS PHASED, NEITHER FIRED NOR RETURNING ROUNDS CAN HURT IT. WATCH IT CHANGE, AND RECALL ONCE IT TURNS SOLID AGAIN."],
	"boss_observed": ["观测对象 · 叠加态实验体", "THE OBSERVED · SUPERPOSED SUBJECT"],
	"note_boss_observed": ["观测体 · 会同时出现在多个位置，每个虚影都能发动攻击。利用子弹的回收轨迹攻击这些虚影，命中真身后，叠加状态就会坍缩，真身也会显现出来。只有真身能够受到伤害，随着战斗继续，虚影的数量还会增加。", "OBSERVED SUBJECT · APPEARS IN SEVERAL PLACES AT ONCE, AND EVERY PHANTOM CAN ATTACK. SWEEP THE PHANTOMS WITH YOUR RECALL PATHS: HIT THE REAL ONE AND ITS SUPERPOSITION COLLAPSES, REVEALING IT. ONLY THE REAL ONE TAKES DAMAGE, AND THE PHANTOMS MULTIPLY AS THE FIGHT GOES ON."],
	"radio_observed": ["观测实验现已开始，请勿直视实验对象，您的注视会改变实验结果。", "THE OBSERVATION EXPERIMENT HAS BEGUN. DO NOT LOOK DIRECTLY AT THE SUBJECT; YOUR GAZE WILL CHANGE THE RESULT."],
	"radio_observed_1": ["实验对象已经出现在第四个位置。研究所确认，目前一切正常。", "THE SUBJECT HAS APPEARED IN A FOURTH POSITION. THE INSTITUTE CONFIRMS ALL IS CURRENTLY NORMAL."],
	"radio_observed_2": ["实验对象已经开始模仿观测人员的行为，研究所建议立即停止观测。", "THE SUBJECT HAS BEGUN TO IMITATE THE OBSERVERS. THE INSTITUTE RECOMMENDS STOPPING OBSERVATION AT ONCE."],
