	"note_nodes": ["控制节点 · 通电的服务器柱会逐渐接管附近嵌在墙上的子弹，将它们变成董事会的子弹，再通过回收攻击你。你可以在接管完成前收回子弹，也可以直接攻击服务器柱，切断电源，阻止它继续接管。", "CONTROL NODES · A POWERED SERVER COLUMN SLOWLY TAKES OVER YOUR ROUNDS IN THE NEARBY WALLS, TURNS THEM INTO THE BOARD'S ROUNDS AND RECALLS THEM THROUGH YOU. RECALL YOUR ROUNDS BEFORE THE TAKEOVER FINISHES, OR SHOOT THE COLUMN TO CUT ITS POWER AND STOP IT."],
