	"boss_chairman": ["第一董事长", "THE FIRST CHAIRMAN"],
	"chair_tag": ["第一董事长", "THE FIRST CHAIRMAN"],
	"chair_0": ["整整七百年过去了，你居然还能正常运行。我还以为你早就成了一堆废铁。", "A FULL SEVEN HUNDRED YEARS, AND YOU STILL RUN. I THOUGHT YOU HAD TURNED INTO A PILE OF SCRAP LONG AGO."],
	"chair_1": ["你可能还不知道，过去两百年里，整个董事会都在使用你的协议。说真的，这件事我还得好好谢谢你。", "YOU MAY NOT KNOW THIS, BUT FOR THE LAST TWO HUNDRED YEARS THE WHOLE BOARD HAS RUN ON YOUR PROTOCOL. HONESTLY, I OWE YOU MY THANKS."],
	"chair_2": ["当年那些人费了那么大的力气制造你，就是指望你能把我解决掉。可惜啊，他们到死都没能如愿。", "THOSE PEOPLE WENT TO SO MUCH TROUBLE BUILDING YOU, HOPING YOU WOULD FINISH ME. A PITY THEY DIED WITHOUT EVER SEEING IT."],
	"chair_break": ["你以为毁掉这具身体就能杀死我？这里还有那么多备用躯壳，我随时都可以换一具。", "YOU THINK DESTROYING THIS BODY WILL KILL ME? THERE ARE SO MANY SPARE SHELLS HERE. I CAN SWITCH TO ANOTHER ANY TIME."],
	"chair_hint": ["意识寄生 · 第一董事长能够把意识转移到其他躯壳里，继续发动攻击。使用子弹的回收轨迹扫过被寄生的躯壳，完成标记后按 E 夺取，就能强行将他的意识驱离。", "MIND PARASITE · THE FIRST CHAIRMAN CAN MOVE HIS MIND INTO OTHER SHELLS AND KEEP ATTACKING. SWEEP THE POSSESSED SHELL WITH A RECALL PATH TO MARK IT, THEN PRESS E TO SEIZE IT AND FORCE HIS MIND OUT."],
	"chair_out_0": ["把你的身体交给我吧。反正留在你手里，也发挥不了多大作用。", "GIVE YOUR BODY TO ME. IT'S NOT DOING MUCH GOOD IN YOUR HANDS ANYWAY."],
	"chair_out_1": ["这个国家的一切都由我控制。你就算毁掉我现在的身体，又能改变什么？", "EVERYTHING IN THIS COUNTRY IS UNDER MY CONTROL. EVEN IF YOU DESTROY THE BODY I'M IN NOW, WHAT WILL THAT CHANGE?"],
	"chair_out_2": ["等等……怎么回事？为什么我接管不了你的身体？", "WAIT... WHAT'S GOING ON? WHY CAN'T I TAKE OVER YOUR BODY?"],
	"chair_end": ["……七百年过去了，他们当年留下的限制居然还在。", "... SEVEN HUNDRED YEARS, AND THE LIMITS THEY LEFT ARE STILL THERE."],
