	"end_1": ["过去被隐藏的历史记录，现已向全体股东公开。", "THE HISTORY THAT WAS HIDDEN IS NOW OPEN TO EVERY SHAREHOLDER."],
	"end_2": ["意识控制协议已经解除，幸福指数目前无法统计。", "THE MIND CONTROL PROTOCOL HAS BEEN LIFTED. THE HAPPINESS INDEX CAN NO LONGER BE MEASURED."],
	"end_3": ["第十三街将在今晚恢复供暖。", "TONIGHT, THE HEATING COMES BACK ON 13TH STREET."],
	"end_4": ["维修工接好了最后一根线路，又检查了一遍设备，确认一切正常后才退到旁边。\n“好了，已经修好了。以后想去什么地方，就由你自己决定吧。”", "THE REPAIRMAN CONNECTS THE LAST LINE, CHECKS THE EQUIPMENT ONCE MORE, AND ONLY STEPS ASIDE ONCE EVERYTHING IS RUNNING.\n\"THERE, ALL FIXED. WHEREVER YOU WANT TO GO FROM NOW ON IS YOUR OWN CHOICE.\""],
	"end_5": ["零号机在原地停留了一会儿，随后独自走了出去。七百年来，这是它第一次没有收到任何人的指令，也终于可以自己决定接下来要做什么。", "UNIT ZERO STAYS WHERE IT IS FOR A WHILE, THEN WALKS OUT ALONE. FOR THE FIRST TIME IN SEVEN HUNDRED YEARS IT HAS NO ORDERS FROM ANYONE, AND AT LAST IT CAN DECIDE FOR ITSELF WHAT TO DO NEXT."],
	"end_6": ["后来有人问维修工，那台机器去哪儿了。维修工想了想，说：“下班了。”", "LATER, SOMEONE ASKED THE REPAIRMAN WHERE THE MACHINE WENT. THE REPAIRMAN THOUGHT ABOUT IT. “OFF SHIFT.”"],
