	"up_possess_2": ["连锁：当前躯壳的附身结束后，意识会自动转移到 450 像素范围内距离最近的已标记敌人身上。", "Chain: when the current shell's possession ends, your mind moves on its own to the nearest marked enemy within 450 px."],
